Package: intertest
Title: Interaction Effect Testing via One-Step Debiased Estimation
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Drago", "Plecko", email = "www.plecko@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides semiparametrically efficient estimators for interaction
    effects in causal graphs with a binary exposure X and outcome Y, mediated
    through pre-exposure confounders Z and mediators W. Supports difference,
    log-risk, and log-odds scales with cross-fitted nuisance estimation via
    gradient boosting.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    xgboost,
    ggplot2,
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
